     4	frozen_problems(): sim/ and scripts/ equal the commit (no change, no untracked file) and no outside override is set.
     5	verify() / require(): every listed file still matches its hash; require() stops the run on any problem.
     6	Usage: commitment.py build <out> <commit> <file>...   |   commitment.py check <manifest>"""
