    37	
    38	## The two pods
    39	
    40	| Pod | Step (launcher admission `--hours`, from `cost_estimate.py`) | Driver call |
    41	|---|---|---|
    42	| 1 | instances 0.05; calibrate 0.25; menu 7.60 (4 of 5 search waves of both families + references); cthr 1.95 (1 wave of each family); inventory | `rep_v2.py --stage <s> --out results/v2/followup3-rep --manifest <bundle>/draw/manifest.json` |
    43	| 2 | rates p0 1.05; gate0 1.20; rates churn 5.02; continue 0.51 (one round of the gate cell; every round is admitted inside); inventory | the same, with pod 1's verified output copied in as `results/v2/followup3-rep` |
    44	
    45	End states on pod 2: a churn stage stopped by the driver's cap (`churn arm stopped between stages`, exit 1) is
