    47	exit 4 is "GATE FAILED at continue", 5 restarts once on 3 workers with the driver's own restart estimate, 6 is
    48	"RUN FAILED at continue (a cell error)".
    49	
    50	## Rulings and open questions for the review
    51	
    52	1. **One run tag and one stop cap for both pods.** Both pods record spend under `replication-<launch tag>`; pod 2's
    53	   PRIOR is pod 1's recorded spend, so the spend card's single cap covers the whole replication. Pod 2 is refused until
    54	   pod 1's spend is recorded (and an open pod 1 reservation refuses it, as any unrecorded earlier launch does). Cost: one
    55	   hour or more between the pods for the balance-difference record.
    56	2. **PLANCAP 33 USD** (the conservative estimate at flag share 0.5 with 1.25 headroom, 32.15, rounded up); the card sets
